  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_necrolord/banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"545\" height=\"118\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>死诞领主</strong> 家具套装，为 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasys-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>奇幻家具</strong></a> 添加了具备完整功能的家具，包括但不限于：<strong>箱子</strong>、<strong>抽屉</strong>、<strong>床</strong>、<strong>座椅</strong>等！</p>\n<p>本家具套装的设计深受 <strong>魔兽世界</strong> <strong>暗影国度资料片</strong> 中 <strong>死诞领主</strong> 盟约的启发。</p>\n<h3>合成配方</h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>合成 <strong>死诞领主砖块</strong>/<strong>死诞领主羊毛</strong> 时，你需要放入 <strong>#minecraft:stone_crafting_materials</strong>/<strong>#minecraft:wool</strong>。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_necrolord/stonecutter_bricks.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_necrolord/stonecutter_wool.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>合成 <strong>死诞领主</strong> 家具方块时，你需要在 <strong>家具制作台</strong> 中放入 <strong>#fantasyfurniture:binding_agent</strong>、<strong>死诞领主砖块</strong> 和 <strong>死诞领主羊毛</strong>。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_necrolord/furniture_station.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.apexmodder.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我们的 <strong>Discord</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.apexmodder.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/third_party/discord_banner.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"174\" height=\"59\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fapexstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/f4d8198a-6c2a-4d86-8d74-1977589e8ef7.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
